  <lyrics>
    <verse name="v1">
      <lines>
      <chord name="Db"/>Look upon Jesus, sinless is He; Father, impute His <chord name="Ab"/>life unto me.<chord name="Ab7"/><br/>
      <chord name="Db"/>My life of scarlet, my sin and <chord name="Gb"/>woe, Cover with <chord name="Db"/>His life, <chord name="Ab7"/>whiter than <chord name="Db"/>snow.<br/>
      <chord name="Ab7"/>Cover with <chord name="Db"/>His life, <chord name="Gb"/>whiter than <chord name="Gb"/>sno<chord name="Db"/>w; <chord name="Eb"/>Fullness of <chord name="Eb7"/>His life then shall I <chord name="Ab"/>kno<chord name="Ab7"/>w;<br/>
      <chord name="Db"/>My life of scarlet, my sin and <chord name="Gb"/>woe, Cover with <chord name="Db"/>His life, <chord name="Ab7"/>whiter than s<chord name="Db"/>now.
      </lines>
    </verse>
    <verse name="c1">
      <lines>
      <chord name="Db"/>Cover with <chord name="Ab"/>His life, <chord name="Ab7"/>whiter than snow;<br/>
      <chord name="Db"/>Fullness <chord name="Gb"/>of His <chord name="Db"/>life <chord name="Ab7"/>then shall <chord name="Db"/>I know;<br/>
      <chord name="Ab7"/><chord name="Db"/>My <chord name="Gb"/>life <chord name="Gb"/>of <chord name="Db"/>scarlet, <chord name="Eb"/>my <chord name="Eb7"/>sin <chord name="Ab"/>and <chord name="Ab7"/>woe,<br/>
      <chord name="Db"/>Cover <chord name="Gb"/>with <chord name="Db"/>His life, <chord name="Ab7"/>whither <chord name="Db"/>than snow.
      </lines>
    </verse>
    <verse name="v2">
      <lines>
      <chord name="Db"/>Deep are <chord name="Ab"/>the wounds <chord name="Ab7"/>transgression has made;<br/>
      <chord name="Db"/>Red <chord name="Gb"/>are the <chord name="Db"/>stains; <chord name="Ab7"/>my soul <chord name="Db"/>is afraid.<br/>
      <chord name="Ab7"/><chord name="Db"/>O <chord name="Gb"/>to <chord name="Gb"/>be <chord name="Db"/><chord name="Eb"/>covered, <chord name="Eb7"/>Jesus, <chord name="Ab"/>with <chord name="Ab7"/>Thee,<br/>
      <chord name="Db"/>Safe <chord name="Gb"/>from the <chord name="Db"/>law <chord name="Ab7"/>that now <chord name="Db"/>judgeth me!
      </lines>
    </verse>
    <verse name="v3">
      <lines>
      <chord name="Db"/>Longing the <chord name="Ab"/>joy of <chord name="Ab7"/>pardon to know;<br/>
      <chord name="Db"/>Jesus <chord name="Gb"/>holds out <chord name="Db"/>a <chord name="Ab7"/>robe white <chord name="Db"/>as snow;<br/>
      <chord name="Ab7"/><chord name="Db"/>&quot;Lord, <chord name="Gb"/>I <chord name="Gb"/>accept <chord name="Db"/><chord name="Eb"/>it! <chord name="Eb7"/>Leaving <chord name="Ab"/>my <chord name="Ab7"/>own,<br/>
      <chord name="Db"/>Gladly <chord name="Gb"/>I <chord name="Db"/>wear Thy <chord name="Ab7"/>pure <chord name="Db"/>life alone.&quot;
      </lines>
    </verse>
    <verse name="v4">
      <lines>
      <chord name="Db"/>Reconciled by <chord name="Ab"/>His death <chord name="Ab7"/>for my sin,<br/>
      <chord name="Db"/>Justified <chord name="Gb"/>by <chord name="Db"/>His life <chord name="Ab7"/>pure <chord name="Db"/>and clean,<br/>
      <chord name="Ab7"/><chord name="Db"/>Sanctified <chord name="Gb"/><chord name="Gb"/>by <chord name="Db"/><chord name="Eb"/>obeying <chord name="Eb7"/><chord name="Ab"/>His <chord name="Ab7"/>word,<br/>
      <chord name="Db"/>Glorified <chord name="Gb"/>when <chord name="Db"/>returneth <chord name="Ab7"/>my <chord name="Db"/>Lord.
